          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo iyo, waka mfungade wichammbwada mndwawomi umweri wikighamba, “Dichakulisha diweni na kukurusha diweni, ela kudirumirie diwangoghe waka wako, kudiinjire waya ghodu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jerusalemu kuaghwa sena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo iyo, lumbashu lwa BWANA luchakaia lughokie, luchue wubaa; na masighariko gha wandu wa Israeli wichaboilwa na kukukasa kwa mavalo gha isanga jawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula mundu uchaasigharika Sioni na Jerusalemu, uo usaghulo ni Mlungu ukaie moyo, uchawangwa mweli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ingelo BWANA uchaaoghosha wuchafu ghwa wandu wa Sioni, na bagha idikie Jerusalemu kwa roho ya kutanya, na roho ya modo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko BWANA uchabonya aighu ya Mghondi ghose ghwa Sioni, na aighu ya ikwanyiko jose ja wandu, iwingu jiwoneke ngelo ya nadime, na mosi, na lumu lwa modo ghuakagha ngelo ya nakio; wubaa ghwa Mlungu ghuchafinikira ugho muzi sa chandarua na kughulindia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
